  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这事儿对我们至关重要  (This Matter Is Vital to Us)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 11 of Behind the Scenes. Riding home after work just as tabloids claim Xin Huimei was photographed with a secret child, Bu Xiaogu presses her well-connected friend for the truth because Xingtian just announced the Golden Class reunion. Listen to Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "确实很有意义。行，我坐你的车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下！新闻说惠美跟一个小孩被拍了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上说那小孩是惠美的私生子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这事儿到底是真的假的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，这事儿对我们至关重要！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "黄金一班刚刚宣布阵容！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有什么希望真的假的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这么一针见血？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，你说吧，什么条件？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "送我上班？没问题啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好啊，一言为定！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "假的？怎么会失望呢！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "确实很有意义。行，我坐你的车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Building charity schools really is meaningful. Sure, I'll take a ride with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下！新闻说惠美跟一个小孩被拍了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on! The news says Huimei was photographed with a young child!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上说那小孩是惠美的私生子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'People online are claiming that child is Huimei's child out of wedlock!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这事儿到底是真的假的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this rumor actually true or false?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，这事儿对我们至关重要！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you, this matter is absolutely vital to our team!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "黄金一班刚刚宣布阵容！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The Golden Class reunion lineup was only just announced!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有什么希望真的假的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean which answer am I hoping for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这么一针见血？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Asking straight to the heart of it like that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，你说吧，什么条件？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, go ahead and name your condition.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "送我上班？没问题啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Drive me to work tomorrow? No problem at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好啊，一言为定！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Deal — you have my word!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "假的？怎么会失望呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's false? Why on earth would I be disappointed!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
